<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 2.604 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 2.604 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 2.604 billion pesos from the secondary market on Friday through five auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    500 million  17 days</p>
<p>    500 million  12 days</p>
<p>    500 million  10 days</p>
<p>    500 million   5 days</p>
<p>    604 million   3 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9507))</p>
